{
    "mapping": "crm-load Salesforce snapshot -> EspoCRM 10.0.12 mapping",
    "mappingVersion": 2,
    "contractVersion": 4,
    "notes": [
        "Values follow docs/MIGRATION-DECISIONS.md D1-D13 (from the CRM-002 delivery) and the PL value tables of CRM-006R (counts-only L3 analysis).",
        "copy: the Salesforce value as is; enum: copied only if it is one of the target options, else left empty with exception enum_unmapped.",
        "Every attribute listed here must exist in the target entityDefs or the 10.0.12 core (TestStatic in tests/load/test_load.py).",
        "Opportunity Post_code__c and Key_Information__c are not in the contract: postcode and keyInformation stay empty.",
        "Contact Phone (Office, primary) and MobilePhone (Mobile) go to phoneNumberData.",
        "Meeting attendees: the owner only (EventRelation is not in the contract). Meeting status: Held if EndDateTime is before the manifest t_start, else Planned.",
        "OpportunityContactRole.Role: null -> \"\"; a value outside Contact.opportunityRole options -> \"\" with exception role_unmapped.",
        "Blank source values are sent as explicit null on create and update (never omitted, so the server never stores an entityDefs default), except Call.direction (see below). Call.duration: a blank CallDurationInSeconds is sent as null; EspoCRM stores 0 (derived from dateEnd - dateStart), which compares equal to blank (exception call_duration_unknown).",
        "Call.direction: CallType Inbound/Outbound map exactly; a blank or unmapped CallType sends no direction (exception call_direction_unknown, plus enum_unmapped when non-blank; EspoCRM shows its core default Outbound).",
        "Contact.salutationName is a core enum validated by EspoCRM (options in enums, listed in coreEnums): a value outside them is sent as null with exception enum_unmapped.",
        "syntheticEnumMap is consulted for a synthetic (selftest) snapshot only; a real snapshot never reads it.",
        "Call.dateStart and Meeting.dateStart are required in core: CompletedDateTime (Call) or StartDateTime/ActivityDateTime (Meeting), else ActivityDate 00:00:00 (exception date_start_from_activity_date), else CreatedDate (exception date_start_from_created). Email.dateSent is never derived from CreatedDate.",
        "Email from is the bare FromAddress; fromString is 'FromName <FromAddress>' or the address alone.",
        "A record whose reference points at a row soft-deleted in the snapshot is not linked to it (exception parent_soft_deleted_in_sf)."
    ],
